    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gacha Party is a tower defense game.</h2><br>One day, an electronic virus spread among the robots, and the tiny robots originally used for housekeeping services awakened! They no longer serve humans, but regard destruction as their ultimate goal~<br><br>&quot;Magic must be defeated by magic&quot;<br>A new generation of beautiful girl dolls was born! Let's duel with microcomputers everywhere!<br><br>In Gacha Party you can experience,<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2605Lovely character image design, battle features adapted to local conditions (\u2299\ua1f4\u2299)</h2>Small people + big props, see how the characters arm themselves with everyday items!<br>Each character has a unique combat weapon - a biscuit, a keyboard, or an old CD!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231880/extras/8debd5d414592fd8fb0c0b07a67e4ec5.poster.avif?t=1684313878\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231880/extras/8debd5d414592fd8fb0c0b07a67e4ec5.webm?t=1684313878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231880/extras/8debd5d414592fd8fb0c0b07a67e4ec5.mp4?t=1684313878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2605Super casual tower defense gameplay \u1555(\u141b)\u1557<br>Experience the classic tower defense gameplay.<br>Levels of different difficulty can be switched freely to see who can fight to the end.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2605Theme scenes of various styles (\ua20d\ufe43 \ua20d)</h2>Cozy cottage, Chinese-style tea table, free to experience various theme scenes!<br>Fight bravely on Cakes, Dreams, Desktop, Refrigerators, and even Ovens to protect your homeland!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231880/extras/9b75316bbc3d2b12185f2908244ece87.poster.avif?t=1684313878\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231880/extras/9b75316bbc3d2b12185f2908244ece87.webm?t=1684313878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231880/extras/9b75316bbc3d2b12185f2908244ece87.mp4?t=1684313878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2605Workshop built-in! Everyone is a creator (\u2265\u25bd\u2264)</h2>We have a built-in workshop in the game, all game modes can be freely edited, uploaded and shared!<br>Let everyone see who is the most creative!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gacha Party is a tower defense game.</h2><br>One day, an electronic virus spread among the robots, and the tiny robots originally used for housekeeping services awakened! They no longer serve humans, but regard destruction as their ultimate goal~<br><br>&quot;Magic must be defeated by magic&quot;<br>A new generation of beautiful girl dolls was born! Let's duel with microcomputers everywhere!<br><br>In Gacha Party you can experience,<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2605Lovely character image design, battle features adapted to local conditions (\u2299\ua1f4\u2299)</h2>Small people + big props, see how the characters arm themselves with everyday items!<br>Each character has a unique combat weapon - a biscuit, a keyboard, or an old CD!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231880/extras/8debd5d414592fd8fb0c0b07a67e4ec5.poster.avif?t=1684313878\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231880/extras/8debd5d414592fd8fb0c0b07a67e4ec5.webm?t=1684313878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231880/extras/8debd5d414592fd8fb0c0b07a67e4ec5.mp4?t=1684313878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2605Super casual tower defense gameplay \u1555(\u141b)\u1557<br>Experience the classic tower defense gameplay.<br>Levels of different difficulty can be switched freely to see who can fight to the end.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2605Theme scenes of various styles (\ua20d\ufe43 \ua20d)</h2>Cozy cottage, Chinese-style tea table, free to experience various theme scenes!<br>Fight bravely on Cakes, Dreams, Desktop, Refrigerators, and even Ovens to protect your homeland!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_